0..75 Comment "//! `niche-realizability` models a null niche as a realizability predicate."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..159 Comment "//! `Option<&T>` uses one word for null or a reference. Its realisers equal the"
160..235 Comment "//! tagged layout at every heap. Marshallers meet their triples. `deref_or`"
236..300 Comment "//! meets the niche. The pathological source refuses `_Nonnull`."
301..304 Comment "//!"
305..384 Comment "//! A realiser is a predicate on a word and heap. `star` splits disjoint heaps."
385..462 Comment "//! `pointsTo` describes a singleton. The normaliser computes assertions. The"
463..499 Comment "//! kernel replays each declaration."
500..503 Comment "//!"
504..581 Comment "//! Limits: the model departs from § 4.2 of the cited work. Both layouts are"
582..659 Comment "//! words by value, not objects behind a reference count, so the model has no"
660..737 Comment "//! `size` and no count. It has no later modality. A triple holds at the heap"
738..815 Comment "//! that it owns, with no frame rule. The checker does not read the C body of"
816..892 Comment "//! `deref_or`, because the lowering does not lower an `extern` declaration."
893..896 Comment "//!"
897..913 Comment "//! - see: #2832"
914..945 Comment "//! - see: #327 — `derefOrWp`"
946..1053 Comment "//! - see: `../../pathological/specification/niche-realizability.gandr` — the refused `_Nonnull` neighbor"
1054..1134 Comment "//! - cites: [Wagner-2024-realistic_realizability_specifying_abis_you_can_count]"
1135..1326 Comment "//! [Wagner-2024-realistic_realizability_specifying_abis_you_can_count]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3689755 \"Wagner, Eisbach and Ahmed, Realistic Realizability: Specifying ABIs You Can Count On\""
